            "review_text": "Do Van Nhi\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nRelax and Good\nJun 2025 • Friends\nI dined here in the evening in a private room, the service was fast, the food was delicious, and the beer was great. However, the atmosphere in the beer hall was quite noisy, which can be considered a typical characteristic of Hanoi’s Bia Hoi restaurants.\nWritten June 18, 2025",
